# One step writes a note, a later step hands what it reads to `logging.info`, a call: the read is used, so the note
# stands between the two steps.

route logged.run
step run/save
step run/show
line entry > run call
line run/save > File(data/note.txt) own
line File(data/note.txt) > run/show own

side entry left
side File(data/note.txt) between
